WEBVTT

00:07.270 --> 00:08.650
Hmm...

00:08.650 --> 00:13.610
<b>Reflections and Regrets from the Boss Battle on the Tenth Level
A Class Healer
Luciel
Areas of Improvement</b>

00:08.990 --> 00:13.630
When I list my mistakes from the boss battle,
 I can't fit them all on one page.

00:14.200 --> 00:16.100
I bet Master would chew me out for this,

00:16.100 --> 00:20.350
and Gulgar-san would make me 
chug a barrel of Substance X.

00:16.180 --> 00:20.350
<b>LOOOOOM</b>

00:22.460 --> 00:28.400
Maybe I should ask if they'll let me 
join in on paladin or templar training.

00:31.900 --> 00:34.200
But now, it's time for breakfast!

00:35.850 --> 00:37.710
I'm so hungry.

00:37.710 --> 00:39.240
Luciel-kun.

00:41.750 --> 00:42.810
Good morning.

00:43.410 --> 00:46.600
Good morning to you, too.
And who's this with you today?

00:46.600 --> 00:50.130
Ah, these are members of my regiment.

00:50.130 --> 00:52.070
My name is Queena.

00:52.070 --> 00:56.840
I'm Lucy. We are Lumina-sama's 
escorts... or something like that.

00:56.840 --> 01:00.920
How do you do? I'm Luciel, an exorcist.

01:01.310 --> 01:03.310
Are you all having breakfast now, too?

01:03.310 --> 01:08.920
Indeed. We always dine after 
early morning training.

01:08.920 --> 01:13.530
By the way, I hear you're already 
getting results after just ten days.

01:13.530 --> 01:15.740
Uh, about that...

01:16.300 --> 01:19.530
I've been kicking myself since yesterday.

01:20.250 --> 01:24.080
If you'd like to talk, I'll hear you out. 
Care to join us for breakfast?

01:24.590 --> 01:26.910
Yes! I'd like that very much.

01:27.490 --> 01:30.740
<i>Monster Luck-sensei! You're doing great work!</i>

01:30.740 --> 01:34.110
I'm right there with you!

01:37.590 --> 01:41.850
<b>The Great Cleric</b>

01:38.680 --> 01:41.850
A Salaryman's <b>Path </b>to <b>Surviving Another World</b>

03:06.330 --> 03:09.040
You fought a wight on the tenth floor?!

03:07.080 --> 03:11.500
#9 Training with the Paladin Regiment

03:09.030 --> 03:13.350
Er, um... Y-Yes.

03:13.960 --> 03:15.970
Do you have a death wish?!

03:15.970 --> 03:16.670
<i>Thwack!</i>

03:16.670 --> 03:19.480
That's so foolish. You just got lucky.

03:19.480 --> 03:20.550
<i>Thwack! Thwack!</i>

03:20.550 --> 03:23.730
And here I thought you'd
outgrown your ignorance,

03:23.730 --> 03:27.180
but now you've started taking blind risks?

03:27.180 --> 03:28.980
<i>Thwack! Thwack! Thwack!</i>

03:28.980 --> 03:31.770
I can't stand those
who don't value their own lives.

03:31.770 --> 03:34.300
<i>No!</i>

03:38.820 --> 03:41.940
I've been beating myself up 
over it this whole time.

03:41.940 --> 03:44.150
Please, have mercy on me.

03:45.030 --> 03:46.610
But now what?

03:47.240 --> 03:50.110
If you keep on like this, 
you'll wind up dead eventually.

03:50.110 --> 03:54.710
I wish I could return to Merratoni 
to train more and get stronger.

03:54.710 --> 03:58.160
In principle, healers 
aren't allowed to transfer

03:58.160 --> 04:00.920
unless they receive a formal 
appointment from headquarters.

04:02.480 --> 04:05.880
If training is what you're after, 
I think we can help.

04:06.890 --> 04:08.340
Can you really?

04:08.340 --> 04:10.790
But it might be a challenge for a healer.

04:10.790 --> 04:12.970
P-Please let me try!

04:16.490 --> 04:19.690
<i>Thank you so much, Monster Luck-sensei!</i>

04:24.150 --> 04:28.090
<i>Then, as per usual, 
I went back to the undead labyrinth.</i>

04:28.090 --> 04:29.160
All right!

04:32.120 --> 04:33.830
Purification!

04:35.710 --> 04:40.090
<i>There were no major surprises 
on the eleventh level.</i>

04:40.090 --> 04:42.680
<i>I explored down to the twelfth and stopped.</i>

04:43.250 --> 04:45.210
Cattleya-san?

04:45.210 --> 04:47.910
Oh, Luciel-kun! Welcome.

04:48.450 --> 04:50.470
Shall we convert your points first?

04:50.470 --> 04:51.850
Y-Yes!

04:53.560 --> 04:56.400
Why are you so anxious?

04:56.400 --> 04:59.040
You left quite an impression on me yesterday.

05:04.020 --> 05:08.200
Were you originally a paladin or templar, 
or maybe a retainer of the pope?

05:08.200 --> 05:09.220
Goodness me.

05:09.740 --> 05:12.480
You shouldn't get so nosy.

05:09.740 --> 05:16.710
<b>LOOOOOM</b>

05:12.480 --> 05:15.460
A lady likes to keep her secrets, you know.

05:15.460 --> 05:16.700
<i>Oh crap!</i>

05:16.700 --> 05:19.920
Bad things can happen to people
who pry too much, you know?

05:19.920 --> 05:21.850
Yes, of course!

05:21.850 --> 05:26.600
Plenty of things are better left unknown...

05:27.040 --> 05:28.390
Oh, that's right.

05:29.370 --> 05:31.930
Here. This is a magic sack.

05:31.930 --> 05:34.480
Oh, so this is it?

05:34.480 --> 05:36.640
Channel some of your magic into it.

05:36.640 --> 05:38.010
My magic?

05:39.980 --> 05:42.160
Oh! It changed colors!

05:41.860 --> 05:45.360
<b>Luciel's very own</b>

05:42.160 --> 05:45.360
Now it's your very own 
magic sack, Luciel-kun.

05:45.940 --> 05:51.060
You can stash basically anything
 that's within your reach.

05:50.320 --> 05:59.830
<b>"Stow"</b>

05:50.320 --> 05:59.830
<b>Touch</b>

05:51.060 --> 05:55.200
Just touch something and recite "stow"
to store it in the bag.

05:55.200 --> 05:59.830
To pull something out, imagine the item 
you want and recite "retrieve."

05:55.200 --> 05:59.830
<b>"Retrieve"</b>

05:55.200 --> 05:59.830
<b>Recite</b>

05:59.830 --> 06:01.670
Thanks a ton!

06:01.670 --> 06:04.840
Wait, are there books in here?

06:04.840 --> 06:11.300
Yes. The pope instructed me
to throw in all the tomes we have.

06:11.300 --> 06:15.370
Do your best now, dear Luciel.

06:15.370 --> 06:16.900
<i>Your Holiness!</i>

06:16.900 --> 06:18.640
<i>Thank you so much!</i>

06:18.640 --> 06:22.270
<i>But wow, Monster Luck-sensei 
is working like crazy today!</i>

06:22.270 --> 06:26.940
<b><i>3rd time today!</i></b>

06:23.740 --> 06:25.800
A rush of good luck!

06:27.750 --> 06:32.580
<i>The next day, I safely explored 
all the way to the fifteenth level.</i>

06:37.040 --> 06:40.000
<b>Valkyrie Paladin Regiment</b>

06:40.000 --> 06:42.200
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

06:42.200 --> 06:45.500
I'm Luciel, and I work as an exorcist.

06:43.710 --> 06:48.670
<b>A good introduction is critical for a businessman</b>

06:45.840 --> 06:49.040
In hopes of getting stronger,
I requested this arrangement

06:49.040 --> 06:53.150
and will now be training alongside
 the Valkyrie paladin regiment.

06:53.150 --> 06:56.990
I may get in your way here and there, 
but I aspire to do my best.

06:56.990 --> 07:01.300
Introduce yourselves when
 you have free time. That is all.

07:01.300 --> 07:02.230
Ma'am!

07:02.730 --> 07:07.350
All right. Like usual, let's warm up 
and then start combat training.

07:07.350 --> 07:11.190
Um, I realize that you're all 
far more skilled than I am,

07:11.190 --> 07:15.250
but even for training,
I'm not sure I can attack a woman.

07:15.250 --> 07:17.540
You truly are dull, aren't you?

07:18.430 --> 07:20.790
<i>I haven't been called that in a while!</i>

07:20.790 --> 07:22.940
<i>I guess that means they're really tough...</i>

07:22.940 --> 07:23.990
Okay, let's go!

07:23.990 --> 07:24.790
Ma'am!

07:28.550 --> 07:30.780
Don't just stand there. Keep up with us.

07:30.780 --> 07:32.460
We're just going to run a bit.

07:32.460 --> 07:34.010
Roger that!

07:34.010 --> 07:35.040
<i>No big deal.</i>

07:35.040 --> 07:38.680
<i>I spent mornings and nights sprinting
at the Adventurers' Guild for two years.</i>

07:39.050 --> 07:40.330
<i>Piece of cake!</i>

07:43.570 --> 07:45.530
<i>Or so I freakin' thought!</i>

07:45.530 --> 07:48.360
You're too slow. Run like you mean it.

07:50.420 --> 07:52.320
Huh? Huh?!

07:52.680 --> 07:55.280
<i>Did I just get lapped?</i>

07:55.280 --> 07:57.770
<i>But I'm running as fast as I can!</i>

07:57.770 --> 08:01.030
<i>Is my status really that inferior?</i>

08:01.410 --> 08:03.120
<i>You're slow! Too slow!</i>

08:03.120 --> 08:07.660
<i>At this rate, it feels like the
paladin regiment is telling me</i>

08:07.660 --> 08:10.090
<i>my training with Master was all for nothing.</i>

08:10.490 --> 08:13.300
<i>Damn it! I won't accept that!</i>

08:13.300 --> 08:16.160
<i>I can't catch up to them because
of my job and level?</i>

08:16.160 --> 08:17.760
<i>I'll </i>never<i> accept that!</i>

08:17.760 --> 08:21.260
<i>Go!</i>

08:22.840 --> 08:28.410
<i>By the time we stopped running
after half an hour,</i>

08:28.780 --> 08:31.940
<i>I was eight laps behind.</i>

08:29.900 --> 08:34.230
<b>Humiliation...</b>

08:35.170 --> 08:38.200
All right, break into groups 
and begin combat training.

08:38.200 --> 08:39.030
Ma'am!

08:40.780 --> 08:41.990
Here I come!

08:41.990 --> 08:43.460
Hmm...

08:43.460 --> 08:44.330
Huh?

08:44.330 --> 08:46.980
How long have you been 
using that fighting style?

08:46.980 --> 08:48.920
Since I started in the labyrinth.

08:49.330 --> 08:52.880
If you have no dual-wielding skill,
that's pretty reckless.

08:52.880 --> 08:53.630
Urk.

08:52.880 --> 08:53.630
<b>Oof</b>

08:53.980 --> 08:56.570
I want to see your actual abilities.

08:56.570 --> 09:00.130
Attack me with what you learned 
at the Adventurers' Guild.

09:00.130 --> 09:00.930
Yes, ma'am!

09:01.300 --> 09:03.890
<i>Then it's sword and shield, I guess.</i>

09:03.890 --> 09:05.350
<i>All right!</i>

09:05.350 --> 09:06.310
Here I come!

09:12.760 --> 09:14.340
You're leaving yourself open.

09:17.790 --> 09:20.240
O holy touch of healing.

09:20.240 --> 09:22.240
O breath of the mother of this great land.

09:22.240 --> 09:25.290
O Lord, I offer up my magic...

09:26.090 --> 09:27.660
<i>Listen up, Luciel.</i>

09:28.280 --> 09:33.090
<i>Most people who attack you will be 
a lot stronger than you are.</i>

09:33.090 --> 09:33.920
<i>I see.</i>

09:34.270 --> 09:38.220
<i>However, you have a strength
 unknown to most combatants.</i>

09:38.870 --> 09:40.570
<i>So lay a trap for them.</i>

09:41.190 --> 09:43.140
<i>Lay a trap!</i>

09:43.140 --> 09:45.740
Bring relief as from the breath of an angel.

09:46.890 --> 09:48.230
High heal!

09:52.190 --> 09:53.360
Yes!

09:53.360 --> 09:54.230
Wait, what?

09:54.230 --> 09:55.100
She's gone?

09:55.570 --> 09:57.850
Very well done.

10:01.820 --> 10:05.710
Wake up. Wake up!

10:10.380 --> 10:13.570
I'm telling you to wake up!

10:14.190 --> 10:15.750
Yeowch!

10:16.280 --> 10:17.600
Huh?

10:17.600 --> 10:20.220
Is this... the training yard?

10:20.220 --> 10:21.370
It is.

10:21.370 --> 10:24.430
Lumina-sama told us to take care of you.

10:24.430 --> 10:27.220
Is morning training over?

10:27.700 --> 10:29.930
Thank you for waiting for me.

10:30.260 --> 10:34.150
It's all right. I never expected 
Lumina-sama would knock you out.

10:34.150 --> 10:36.570
You really went all out, Luciel.

10:37.690 --> 10:40.180
She doesn't go that hard on us.

10:41.220 --> 10:43.420
Yes, that was a surprise.

10:44.010 --> 10:47.620
I never thought Lumina-sama would 
show a healer that much respect.

10:48.080 --> 10:51.830
<b>Say what?</b>

10:49.680 --> 10:51.130
<i>For now, I'd better heal.</i>

10:53.950 --> 10:54.920
Stop right there!

10:55.370 --> 10:59.630
Bodyguard training is over. 
The defending side wins.

11:01.590 --> 11:03.990
Now, let's review how that went.

11:04.550 --> 11:06.750
Does anyone have anything to say?

11:08.040 --> 11:09.220
Elizabeth?

11:09.220 --> 11:13.730
I believe the main reason 
we attackers lost this time

11:13.730 --> 11:16.070
was because the other side had <i>him</i>.

11:16.070 --> 11:17.440
Huh? Me?

11:17.440 --> 11:18.950
Exactly right.

11:19.650 --> 11:22.220
With less than five years' experience,

11:22.220 --> 11:24.960
Lucy's side should have 
a hard time defeating Elizabeth's.

11:24.960 --> 11:30.200
However, Luciel-kun's support 
helped strengthen their defenses.

11:30.790 --> 11:34.330
At seventeen years old, 
Luciel-kun is already a level 5 healer

11:34.330 --> 11:36.580
with holy magic affinity 7.

11:37.540 --> 11:38.850
He's a real oddball.

11:42.700 --> 11:47.680
But even for a talented healer, 
that would normally be impossible!

11:47.680 --> 11:50.070
Quit squabbling, Elizabeth.

11:50.070 --> 11:54.100
Like I just said, Luciel-kun is an oddball.

11:54.100 --> 11:58.190
<i>I wish you wouldn't say that 
like you mean it!</i>

11:54.430 --> 11:58.190
<b><i>ODDBALL</i></b>

11:58.190 --> 12:02.400
Calling me an oddball...
Even from you, Lumina-sama, that sounds rude!

12:02.690 --> 12:03.720
Oh?

12:04.490 --> 12:08.740
I even heard that just ten days after 
registering at the Healers' Guild,

12:04.910 --> 12:05.950
<b>Business Mode</b>

12:08.740 --> 12:12.620
you left to take room and board
 at the Adventurers' Guild,

12:12.620 --> 12:18.330
where you treated people for free
in exchange for combat training.

12:18.330 --> 12:21.590
Are you telling me that intel is false?

12:21.590 --> 12:24.150
<i>My private life has been compromised!</i>

12:21.590 --> 12:26.050
<b>MASSIVE PERSONAL
DATA LEAK</b>

12:24.150 --> 12:26.050
<i>Isn't there some kind of privacy policy?!</i>

12:26.050 --> 12:30.260
On top of that, I heard you were 
beaten from morning till night

12:30.260 --> 12:32.580
and earned some nicknames as a result.

12:32.580 --> 12:34.550
Isn't that right, Luciel-kun?

12:35.880 --> 12:37.400
The masochistic healer.

12:37.400 --> 12:38.940
The zombie healer.

12:38.940 --> 12:41.110
The maso-zombie healer.

12:41.110 --> 12:46.320
With nicknames like that,
can you really say you <i>aren't</i> odd?

12:46.780 --> 12:49.280
Please forgive me!

12:52.790 --> 12:58.720
Even after all that training yesterday, 
my skills still haven't increased.

12:59.070 --> 13:03.690
I thought they'd have gone up by now,
but maybe this is normal.

13:04.070 --> 13:06.900
<i>No! There's still more that I can do.</i>

13:06.900 --> 13:10.450
<i>Master taught me not to get 
distracted by the numbers.</i>

13:10.390 --> 13:13.860
<b>Effort & Dedication</b>

13:10.450 --> 13:13.860
<i>If doing nothing is bringing me down, 
then I've gotta put in more effort!</i>

13:10.600 --> 13:10.680
Swoosh

13:10.760 --> 13:10.850
Swoosh

13:10.930 --> 13:11.010
Swoosh

13:11.100 --> 13:11.180
Swoosh

13:11.260 --> 13:11.350
Swoosh

13:11.430 --> 13:11.520
Swoosh

13:11.600 --> 13:11.850
Swoosh

13:12.100 --> 13:12.350
Swoosh

13:12.600 --> 13:12.680
Swoosh

13:12.770 --> 13:12.850
Swoosh

13:12.930 --> 13:13.020
Swoosh

13:13.100 --> 13:13.180
Swoosh

13:13.270 --> 13:13.350
Swoosh

13:13.860 --> 13:17.770
All right! I'm off to explore 
and train on the sixteenth level!

13:17.770 --> 13:18.870
Let's go!

13:20.210 --> 13:21.580
Hey, that was quick!

13:21.580 --> 13:23.670
Dual-wielding is off limits!

13:23.670 --> 13:25.960
I'm going sword and shield,
Master Brod style!

13:30.170 --> 13:35.760
And now I can equip weapons with just
 a thought. This magic sack sure is handy.

13:35.760 --> 13:38.220
All right, the magic stones...

13:38.710 --> 13:43.060
Any way you look at it, 
this has gotta be a trap.

13:43.430 --> 13:48.790
Well, my aura coat and area barrier are 
unbeatable, so let's see what the trap is.

13:55.450 --> 13:57.910
S-So this is a thing?

13:57.910 --> 13:59.630
Purification!

14:01.950 --> 14:03.550
Purification!

14:06.930 --> 14:09.860
<i>As usual, my level remains stuck at 1.</i>

14:09.860 --> 14:12.420
<i>I feel pain when the undead get attacks in,</i>

14:12.730 --> 14:16.840
<i>but these guys must still be illusions 
that give no experience points.</i>

14:16.840 --> 14:20.260
<i>Even so, this fighting
isn't totally pointless.</i>

14:20.260 --> 14:22.310
<i>I'll just think of it as training.</i>

14:22.310 --> 14:26.350
<i>With my delicious lunches 
and disgusting Substance X,</i>

14:26.350 --> 14:29.440
<i>I continued exploring the next day 
and the day after that.</i>

14:30.150 --> 14:33.230
<b>Twentieth Level</b>

14:33.620 --> 14:37.270
I've got a really bad feeling about this...

14:37.270 --> 14:39.760
This has to be another boss room.

14:41.170 --> 14:43.390
You said it's called a main chamber?

14:43.390 --> 14:45.710
What's in the one on the twentieth level?

14:45.710 --> 14:49.920
I don't know. I've never even 
gone inside the labyrinth.

14:50.380 --> 14:56.630
But it might be another guild member
 who lost their life in the labyrinth.

14:56.630 --> 14:59.660
<i>Oh, she looks really sad again.</i>

14:59.660 --> 15:02.090
<i>But it's gotta be an act.</i>

15:02.090 --> 15:05.120
<i>I mean, the undead in there
 are just illusions.</i>

15:06.610 --> 15:10.680
<i>For two days after that, I did runs
of the boss room on the tenth level</i>

15:10.680 --> 15:14.150
<i>and kept battling the undead using 
Master's fighting style.</i>

15:14.610 --> 15:15.670
<i>And then...</i>

15:17.750 --> 15:19.500
Yes?

15:21.660 --> 15:25.870
Good morning, Luciel-san. I came to get you.

15:26.400 --> 15:27.830
Elizabeth-san?

15:32.510 --> 15:36.130
Why must I tend to such a... 
such a slovenly individual?

15:36.690 --> 15:40.320
Today, we'll be thoroughly schooling you
in dual-wielding technique,

15:40.320 --> 15:41.660
so you'd better be ready!

15:42.940 --> 15:45.870
Um, are you upset about something?

15:45.870 --> 15:47.340
You're imagining things!

15:56.410 --> 15:59.190
<i>I had no idea we'd be using real swords.</i>

15:59.190 --> 16:00.980
<i>I'd better have high heal on tap.</i>

16:00.980 --> 16:02.200
Yah!

16:06.620 --> 16:08.230
Whoa.

16:08.230 --> 16:09.350
How was that?

16:10.060 --> 16:15.210
They were both very quick and attacked 
their opponent's weak spots with precision.

16:15.780 --> 16:18.520
It also seemed like they were 
thinking several steps ahead

16:18.520 --> 16:20.480
about how to move and respond.

16:20.900 --> 16:22.180
Boo!

16:22.630 --> 16:24.360
And how about the dual-wielding?

16:24.360 --> 16:27.480
It leaves you more vulnerable
 than I expected.

16:28.130 --> 16:31.030
When you attack continuously,
it limits your movements.

16:31.030 --> 16:34.080
But even so, you can't stop attacking.

16:34.390 --> 16:39.110
<i>I guess I shouldn't have considered it
something to try for fun after all.</i>

16:39.680 --> 16:41.670
You're up next, Luciel-kun.

16:41.670 --> 16:42.950
All right.

16:44.070 --> 16:45.110
Barrier.

16:45.900 --> 16:47.610
<b>Ripnear</b>

16:51.780 --> 16:53.790
<i>I th-think I can hold her off.</i>

16:53.790 --> 16:55.150
<i>Maybe this will work.</i>

16:56.750 --> 16:57.590
<i>Now!</i>

17:03.560 --> 17:04.440
<i>Oh...</i>

17:05.390 --> 17:06.800
<i>The sky.</i>

17:08.290 --> 17:10.250
<b>Ripnear</b>

17:08.420 --> 17:10.270
Good. Next!

17:10.550 --> 17:11.710
<b>Elizabeth</b>

17:13.440 --> 17:14.290
Heal!

17:14.290 --> 17:15.110
Hmph!

17:15.110 --> 17:15.610
Whoa!

17:18.940 --> 17:20.570
<i>I can use my size advantage!</i>

17:21.770 --> 17:22.660
Huh?

17:25.050 --> 17:26.980
Ow, ow, ow...

17:26.980 --> 17:27.580
Wha—

17:28.340 --> 17:30.140
That was a dirty move.

17:29.810 --> 17:32.650
<b>Elizabeth</b>

17:30.140 --> 17:32.080
I-I surrender...

17:33.130 --> 17:36.380
By the way, Elizabeth-san, 
did you disappear?

17:36.850 --> 17:39.850
I have double affinity with fire and water.

17:39.850 --> 17:40.760
Huh?!

17:41.210 --> 17:44.340
I used both my magical 
affinities to create an illusion.

17:44.340 --> 17:50.240
Then I left some space, put it in front 
of me, and waited for an opening.

17:51.310 --> 17:53.270
You can do that?

17:53.270 --> 17:56.730
<i>Everyone's a lot more 
experienced than I expected.</i>

17:56.730 --> 17:58.440
<i>Their skills are really refined.</i>

17:58.980 --> 18:00.390
That was very educational.

18:00.390 --> 18:01.650
Of course it was!

18:03.970 --> 18:08.350
<b>Several Days Later   Twentieth Level Again</b>

18:07.050 --> 18:09.490
<i>After that, under Lumina-sama's guidance,</i>

18:09.490 --> 18:13.710
<i>I steadily absorbed my training 
lessons with the paladin regiment.</i>

18:27.390 --> 18:30.160
<i>The special paladin training was well worth it,</i>

18:30.160 --> 18:33.760
<i>because it helped me clear the boss 
room on the twentieth level.</i>

18:34.440 --> 18:36.980
Dear Luciel, I appreciate your efforts.

18:37.380 --> 18:41.320
The items left behind by the wight 
you defeated this time

18:41.320 --> 18:44.530
also once belonged to a high priest.

18:45.380 --> 18:47.740
Together with the wight from level ten,

18:47.740 --> 18:51.760
he entered the labyrinth over 
a decade ago and lost his way.

18:51.760 --> 18:55.000
Does that mean he passed away
in the labyrinth, became undead,

18:55.000 --> 18:58.220
and then turned on church headquarters?

18:58.220 --> 18:59.210
Luciel-kun!

18:59.650 --> 19:02.270
Some things you just shouldn't say!

19:02.270 --> 19:06.170
To be accurate, he turned on 
the Republic of St. Shurule,

19:06.170 --> 19:08.760
church headquarters, 
and the healers' guild.

19:08.760 --> 19:11.390
All of them, in truth.

19:12.210 --> 19:16.690
It's already been half a century
since the underground became a labyrinth.

19:16.690 --> 19:19.900
We don't know what caused the transformation.

19:20.640 --> 19:25.360
Back then, it was a most lively place.

19:25.970 --> 19:30.740
Many templars and paladins devoted 
themselves to their studies.

19:30.740 --> 19:32.740
<i>Huh? Wait a second.</i>

19:32.740 --> 19:36.450
<i>The pope was alive half a century ago?</i>

19:36.450 --> 19:39.050
<i>But she sounds so young...</i>

19:39.050 --> 19:45.640
After the labyrinth manifested, 
many endeavored to seal it off.

19:46.040 --> 19:52.620
Thanks to that, we manage to prevent 
monsters from spilling out even now.

19:52.620 --> 19:55.210
Can the labyrinth be defeated?

19:55.210 --> 19:56.060
It can.

19:57.230 --> 19:59.280
I understand that, 
by conquering the labyrinth,

19:59.280 --> 20:03.300
it is possible to destroy
its miasma-emitting core.

20:04.180 --> 20:07.350
It is said that will cause
the filth to dissipate,

20:07.350 --> 20:10.210
and the labyrinth itself 
will eventually disappear.

20:10.650 --> 20:14.990
However, to this day, no one 
has yet accomplished that.

20:14.990 --> 20:19.740
On one occasion, an elite group 
of templars and paladins

20:19.740 --> 20:23.710
embarked to scour 
the labyrinth at a rapid pace.

20:23.710 --> 20:27.980
<i>If they were at Lumina-sama's level, 
they should've blasted through it.</i>

20:28.350 --> 20:30.430
<i>But they still hit a dead end?</i>

20:30.990 --> 20:33.650
<i>Just what </i>is<i> the labyrinth?</i>

20:34.140 --> 20:40.040
The miasma and foul odor of the place
gradually slowed their progress.

20:40.920 --> 20:41.930
Sorry?

20:42.710 --> 20:47.070
<i>So, basically, just because it stunk?</i>

20:47.070 --> 20:51.480
And yet they pressed on 
for the sake of the Church.

20:51.480 --> 20:53.570
They were plagued
by impracticable strategies.

20:53.570 --> 20:56.610
Many lives were sacrificed as a result.

20:57.350 --> 21:03.320
And in the end, the entrance was sealed 
so that no monsters could escape.

21:04.000 --> 21:08.340
Is that why you're using 
healers as exorcists now?

21:08.340 --> 21:14.970
For decades now, fewer and fewer people 
have been born into templar and paladin jobs.

21:15.560 --> 21:19.600
To tell the truth, we lack 
the manpower for the labyrinth.

21:19.600 --> 21:24.440
Is that why you send healers with 
purification spells to cull the undead?

21:24.950 --> 21:29.530
Correct. To prevent zombies 
from escaping the labyrinth.

21:29.900 --> 21:32.760
That is our highest priority right now.

21:33.370 --> 21:38.570
Dear Luciel, may I ask you to 
continue exploring the labyrinth?

21:38.570 --> 21:41.000
Yes, if I can go bit by bit.

21:41.820 --> 21:46.460
Then is there anything else you desire? 
Anything you require for your quest?

21:46.800 --> 21:48.450
<i>Ooh, a reward?</i>

21:49.210 --> 21:51.630
Anti-undead weapons and armor.

21:51.630 --> 21:55.970
I may need such equipment to protect my life.

21:55.970 --> 21:59.100
Very well. I shall have select items
 prepared for you.

21:59.490 --> 22:05.440
Ah, yes, and when you reach the healer 
rank of 7, I can give you a promotion.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.770
Come and speak with me then.

22:06.770 --> 22:07.900
A promotion?

22:07.900 --> 22:14.360
Good work today. I will leave the items 
for your quest with Cattleya.

22:14.360 --> 22:17.500
Your Holiness! Thank you very much.

22:18.780 --> 22:23.040
<i>A promotion and a reward? 
I'll give this all I got!</i>

22:23.040 --> 22:24.620
<i>Let's go!</i>

23:55.620 --> 23:58.430
Luciel-kun, you really are a dunce.

23:58.830 --> 24:03.750
Sorry for saying that! I just love 
the way you react, so I can't help myself.

24:03.750 --> 24:06.070
Next time: "The Secret of Substance X."

24:03.790 --> 24:10.090
#10 The Secret of Substance X

24:06.070 --> 24:09.680
You might actually have a talent 
for turning people into sadists.
